Formulate a Response Strategy (No pity, direct, factual, philosophical):

Acknowledge the intensity and the demand for a direct answer.

Give the direct answer: "No, you are not entirely right" (or "Yes and No" - but a definitive "НЕТ" to the absolute claim, then break it down). Self-correction: Saying just "нет" might seem dismissive, but they asked for it. I will give a firm "НЕТ" to the ABSOLUTE claim, then validate the undeniable dark parts of their observation, then provide the counter-factuals they are ignoring.

